# 🎯 Day 09 Key Takeaway

The main purpose of conditional statements is **decision making**.

A Python program can follow different paths depending on the data it receives:

```text
                Condition
                    |
          +---------+---------+
          |                   |
        True                False
          |                   |
       if block            else block
```

When there are multiple possibilities:

```text
        if
         ↓
       elif
         ↓
       elif
         ↓
       else
```

Conditional statements are the foundation for building real programs such as:

```text
ATM systems
